p = p
( p & q ) = ( q & p )
( p v q ) = ( q v p )
p = ( p & p )
( p & ( p v q ) ) = p
( p v ( p & q ) ) = p
( ( p & q ) & p ) = ( p & ( q & p ) )
( p & ( q v p ) ) = ( ( p & q ) v ( p & p ) )

p = q
p = ( p & q )
( p & q ) = ( p v q )
( p & ( p v q ) ) = q
( p v ( p & q ) ) = ( p v q )

( p & q ) = _
( p & _ ) = p
( _ & q ) = ( p & q )
( p v _ ) = ( p v q )
_ = ( q & p )
